{"sections":{"slideshow_EdQXpE":{"type":"slideshow","blocks":{"image_eqb7QN":{"type":"image","settings":{"subheading":"","title":"OUR STORY","mobile_text_position":"place-self-end-start text-start","desktop_text_position":"sm:place-self-end-start sm:text-start","content_max_width":780,"button_1_text":"","button_1_link":"","button_1_style":"solid","button_1_background":"#ffffff","button_1_text_color":"#000000","button_2_text":"","button_2_link":"","button_2_style":"outline","button_2_background":"#ffffff","button_2_text_color":"#000000","background":"","background_opacity":50,"text_color":"#ffffff","border_color":"","gradient_overlay":"linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(54, 54, 54, 0.2), rgba(4, 4, 4, 0.65) 100%)","heading_shadow_color":"","heading_shadow_x":2,"heading_shadow_y":2,"heading_shadow_blur":6}}},"block_order":["image_eqb7QN"],"disabled":true,"name":"t:sections.slideshow.presets.slideshow.name","settings":{"allow_transparent_header":false,"show_next_section_button":true,"media_size":"auto","autoplay":true,"autoplay_pause_on_video":true,"cycle_speed":5,"background":"#000000","controls_color":"#ffffff"}},"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"color_scheme":"","show_title":true,"page_width":"full"}},"rich_text_xTmwD7":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_RyRML4":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"<strong>ABOUT US<\/strong>","heading_tag":"h1"}}},"block_order":["heading_RyRML4"],"custom_css":[],"name":"t:sections.rich_text.presets.rich_text.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":false,"content_width":"sm","text_position":"center","remove_vertical_spacing":false}},"rich_text_GXhHQb":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"richtext_NPM8Tb":{"type":"richtext","disabled":true,"settings":{"content":"<p>Vntura stands for exceptionality and uniqueness.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["richtext_NPM8Tb"],"name":"t:sections.rich_text.presets.rich_text.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":true,"content_width":"xs","text_position":"center","remove_vertical_spacing":false}},"image_with_text_VGDYRJ":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_TwDUty":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"<strong>A Thoughtful Selection<\/strong>","heading_tag":"h1"}},"richtext_FeL3HR":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>From relaxed fits to sharper cuts, <strong>Kerry Ann’s<\/strong> picks clothes meant for real life. Not every item shouts for attention - some just slip right into your routine. A jacket might stand out Monday through Friday, while a tee stays ready for weekends. Choices lean toward now, without chasing what’s next. Simple shapes meet thoughtful details, pieces that move between settings quietly. Wear them together or apart - they are built to work either way.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_TwDUty","richtext_FeL3HR"],"name":"t:sections.image_with_text.presets.image_with_text.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":false,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/hf_20260312_022813_5efe4ebf-a58c-4e25-a609-4aee5a78684a.png","reveal_on_scroll":true,"image_position":"start","content_width":"md","remove_vertical_spacing":true}},"image_with_text_zawE3K":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_WArE9x":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"<strong>Made for Everyday Style<\/strong>","heading_tag":"h1"}},"richtext_6NXBNd":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>Clothing ought to sit easily on the body, never stiff or forced. From morning coffee to evening walks, these designs shift without fuss. Clean lines meet subtle details, creating looks that move with you. Putting things together doesn’t need rules - just pieces that belong. Effort shows up when everything fits, even if it wasn’t planned.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_WArE9x","richtext_6NXBNd"],"name":"t:sections.image_with_text.presets.image_with_text.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":false,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/hf_20260312_022656_26c44003-5126-40a8-aed4-275c9f65fec0.png","reveal_on_scroll":true,"image_position":"end","content_width":"md","remove_vertical_spacing":true}},"image_with_text_GKmmXd":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_6Ln4DD":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"<strong>Confidence in Simplicity<\/strong>","heading_tag":"h1"}},"richtext_wMq9fa":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>Quiet confidence shows up in tiny choices at <strong>Kerry Ann’s<\/strong>. Simple shapes, careful finishes - these make clothes that sit just right. What you put on feels steady, never loud. Little things do the talking here.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_6Ln4DD","richtext_wMq9fa"],"name":"t:sections.image_with_text.presets.image_with_text.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":false,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/hf_20260312_023015_e3a8191a-10c0-400b-8dea-7c254b8235b0.png","reveal_on_scroll":true,"image_position":"start","content_width":"md","remove_vertical_spacing":true}},"rich_text_hcxgcE":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_AAj69N":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"CONTACT INFORMATION:","heading_tag":"h3"}},"richtext_mD6EKr":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p><strong>Store Name:<\/strong> Kerry Ann's<br\/><strong>Address:<\/strong> <a href=\"https:\/\/maps.app.goo.gl\/KmdHgzoyHPnA9pXW7\">41 York Rd, London SE1 7NJ, United Kingdom<\/a><br\/><strong>Email:<\/strong> <a href=\"mailto:support@kerryanns.com\">support@kerryanns.com<\/a><br\/><strong>Phone:<\/strong> <a href=\"tel:+447418316044\">+44 7418 316044<\/a><br\/><strong>Contact:<\/strong> <a href=\"\/pages\/contact\" title=\"Contact\">Contact Page<\/a><\/p><p><strong>Customer Service:<\/strong> Monday to Friday: 9:00 AM – 5:00 PM BST<\/p><p>We aim to respond to all emails within 1–2 business days.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_AAj69N","richtext_mD6EKr"],"name":"t:sections.rich_text.presets.rich_text.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":false,"content_width":"sm